+## Phase 6: User Story 4 - Snippets survive a restart (Priority: P4)
+
+**Goal**: Every unexpired, unrevoked snippet — content, timestamps, and revocation secret — is
+still valid after the service is stopped and started again against the same data directory, and
+the operator gets a loud, non-zero failure when the service cannot start.
+
+**Independent Test**: Create several snippets, stop the service, start it again against the same
+data directory, and confirm all of them read back identically and that the original revocation
+secrets still work.
+
+### Tests for User Story 4
+
